1
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,640
When you decided to back out,

2
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,000
why didn't you tell me right away?

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,520
You ungrateful son.

4
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,680
What are you doing? Can't you hear me?

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,080
You should stop, Itt.

6
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,000
Don't make things any worse.

7
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,520
This is a very big deal.

8
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:17,760
You really had no idea?

9
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,160
The view from inside the room is different

10
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,600
from the one up on the rooftop.

11
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,080
Give Ing some time.

12
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,040
No one gives a damn about me.

13
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,880
They only care about what they can gain from me.

14
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,560
I said, let go.

15
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,480
What makes you think

16
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,160
I'd ever submit to you?

17
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,280
You idiot.

18
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:06,760
I'm starving.

19
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,240
Can you wait, then?

20
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,480
I could wait an eternity.

21
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,520
But you've got the key now.

22
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:15,120
Just think of this place as your home.

23
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,520
Come here.

24
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,320
Your heart belongs to me.

25
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:20,760
No matter where in the world you go,

26
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:22,760
-you'll still be thinking of me. -Hey, what are you doing?

27
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:56,159
Life's been a struggle for you lately, hasn't it?

28
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,440
If you need anything, we can talk.

29
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,240
Everything is negotiable.

30
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:03,000
We're brothers after all.

31
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:05,200
Listen to me, you little brat.

32
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,040
Even if I'm drowning in debt,

33
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,840
don't you dare think you'll get what's mine.

34
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,760
In this lifetime,

35
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,720
if I ever let a mistress's son like you be happy,

36
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,040
you can call me every filthy name in the book.

37
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,960
Dammit, it just never ends.

38
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,280
[Dad]

39
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:32,800
Yes, Dad.

40
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,840
Ing, I'm at the office.

41
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:38,440
Do you have some time to talk?

42
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,800
Yeah.

43
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:02,960
Ing, how long did you plan on keeping this from me?

44
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,280
I'm not your favorite son,

45
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,880
the type who runs crying to you whenever there's trouble.

46
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,720
Right.

47
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,880
Even if I wanted to tell you, I couldn't.

48
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
The person who brought ruin

49
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,760
upon his own wife and son

50
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,680
was you, wasn't it?

51
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,520
I already gave him a beating.

52
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,280
I didn't hold back at all,

53
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,760
but he wouldn't stop.

54
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:49,920
You're at a disadvantage right now

55
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:53,000
because you have to consider the future of the company

56
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:55,680
and our family's interests.

57
00:07:57,159 --> 00:07:57,960
I see.

58
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:01,160
The company? Our family?

59
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,480
I get it now.

60
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,720
So the reason you came here is...

61
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:08,160
you want me to sell all my shares in the company, right?

62
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,160
Ing,

63
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,520
I can't just stand by

64
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,120
and watch our business crumble

65
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,520
just because you two are out for each other's throats.

66
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,600
To be honest,

67
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,320
you're absolutely right, Dad.

68
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,880
As for my portion,

69
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,840
I'll transfer all of it to you.

70
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:32,039
And that private company I'm running,

71
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,200
I'll hand that over to you as well.

72
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:38,240
But if you insist on pushing like this,

73
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:41,080
you'll bring the Adularaya family down with you.

74
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:43,919
Yeah.

75
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,840
You're completely right, Dad.

76
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,520
Honestly, I'm not even hurt.

77
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,600
Not at all.

78
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:56,960
Your son is just so damn clever, isn't he?

79
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,080
He's a real master of deception.

80
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,800
I guess he really takes after his mom.

81
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,160
Ing.

82
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:09,600
Oh, that's right.

83
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:15,040
Araya Group doesn't belong to me alone.

84
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:18,520
That sixty-seven percent stake I hold...

85
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,600
I can give it up.

86
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,480
Because in the end,

87
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,720
whether it's his or mine,

88
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:30,280
it belongs to Araya Group anyway, doesn't it?

89
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:35,080
Is there anything else he wants?

90
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,000
I'll give it all to him.

91
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:44,040
But I have one request.

92
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:55,080
Alright. Let's hear it.

93
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,200
I want you,

94
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,760
your happy little family,

95
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,920
your favorite son,

96
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,600
and your mistress

97
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,240
to get out of the house.

98
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,560
That house belonged to my mom, didn't it?

99
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:17,280
She was quite pathetic, wasn't she?

100
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,080
She couldn't keep her own husband

101
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,440
or even her own life.

102
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,560
I'm the only one left to protect her memory.

103
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,360
I will not allow a mistress's son

104
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:31,000
to strut around my mom's house,

105
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,560
acting like he owns the place.

106
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,760
Dad,

107
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,920
I won't let that homewrecker

108
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:42,480
disrespect my mom ever again.

109
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,440
I think I've said enough.

110
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,880
You should leave now.

111
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,920
Once I've cleared the paperwork,

112
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:59,000
I'll let Itt know myself.

113
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,480
Oh,

114
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,040
I almost forgot.

115
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,400
There's something I've been meaning to tell you.

116
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:10,880
All this time,

117
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,800
I've been carrying this entire company on my back,

118
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:17,560
along with all the relatives waiting for my handouts.

119
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:22,360
From now on, if anything happens to Araya Group,

120
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:25,120
please don't even think about calling me again.

121
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:28,720
I'm going to live my life for myself.

122
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,840
I think you should take your leave.

123
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,400
I'm too busy to see you out.

124
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,720
Let's just say...

125
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,040
it's a deal.

126
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:55,240
I'll do exactly as you ask.

127
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:33,760
Hello, P'Ing.

128
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,880
Listen to me.

129
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,160
If you want what's mine,

130
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,600
I'll give it all to you.

131
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,720
Not just half the shares,

132
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:45,800
but all sixty-seven percent that I hold.

133
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:47,040
Take every last bit of it.

134
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,680
And after this,

135
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,480
the company will be yours.

136
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:53,320
You can run it into the ground for all I care.

137
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,520
And I won't negotiate the price.

138
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:58,520
You can have it for seventy percent of the market value.

139
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,680
Have you really thought this through?

140
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,560
Stop wasting your breath.

141
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:07,720
But I won't be able to come up

142
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:09,200
with that much cash immediately.

143
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:13,040
And why exactly should that be my problem?

144
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
I'll stop by the legal department today,

145
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,440
sign the notices,

146
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,840
and leave right after.

147
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:21,080
Whenever you get the money,

148
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:23,600
just contact them yourself.

149
00:13:26,800 --> 00:13:28,480
Don't you even want to see me?

150
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:37,480
Do you really hate me that much?

151
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:50,920
P'Piang, come in here for a moment.

152
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:05,680
Yes, sir.

153
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,920
I've just sold all of my shares,

154
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,480
and I'm leaving today.

155
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:17,080
Please have all the necessary paperwork

156
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,440
ready for me to sign.

157
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,080
What's with that look?

158
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:29,320
I'm sorry

159
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:33,600
that you have to get a new boss, Secretary Piang.

160
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,600
The new guy might not have

161
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:39,200
my taste or my looks.

162
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,240
I'm sorry for that.

163
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,440
You don't need to apologize to me.

164
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:46,480
I've seen everything.

165
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:49,720
You're just doing what's best for the company.

166
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,080
I see.

167
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:56,400
In the entire world right now,

168
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,920
you're probably the only one who understands me.

169
00:15:03,160 --> 00:15:05,280
Araya Group won't be the same anymore

170
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,840
without you.

171
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:12,840
If you ever want to start over somewhere else,

172
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,280
just say the word.

173
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,280
Can I?

174
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,680
Oh, for a secretary of your caliber,

175
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:20,200
do you think I could even afford your salary?

176
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:25,840
If you can't afford the salary,

177
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,920
you can always pay me in shares instead.

178
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,840
Smart answer.

179
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:32,160
Anyway...

180
00:15:32,760 --> 00:15:34,480
please have Auntie Chai clean up the office.

181
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:35,720
Understood.

182
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:38,560
A messenger just delivered this.

183
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:41,160
Alright.

184
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:43,720
Please go get Auntie Chai

185
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:44,920
to clean the office.

186
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,440
Yes, sir.

187
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:53,520
P'Piang.

188
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,760
Let's meet again sometime.

189
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:08,280
Yes, I'll see you later.

190
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:30,560
Did you get it yet? Do you like it?

191
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:39,920
Secretary Piang asked me to come and clean, sir.

192
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,600
Yes. Well...

193
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:44,320
I don't need anything in this room anymore.

194
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,600
You're not keeping anything in here?

195
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:47,720
Yeah, that's right.

196
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:50,960
Uh...

197
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,280
Auntie Chai.

198
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:53,320
Here.

199
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:54,760
It's yours.

200
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:57,120
Thank you, Mr. CEO.

201
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:27,839
Hello, Grandpa.

202
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:30,320
Ing, stay right there.

203
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:32,680
I'm having the driver take me to Bangkok.

204
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:33,440
Wait,

205
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,880
why are you coming here?

206
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:37,680
Oh, hey, Grandpa.

207
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:38,920
Don't be mad.

208
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:40,080
You don't need to come.

209
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:40,760
Just stay there.

210
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:42,000
I'll go see you.

211
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:43,960
How can I not be mad?

212
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:45,840
If I don't handle this,

213
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:48,160
those people will just kick you out.

214
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,320
Like mother, like son.

215
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:51,800
He's just like her.

216
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,680
And as for Triyot,

217
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,640
what kind of father is he?

218
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,560
I'm going to teach him a lesson

219
00:17:57,600 --> 00:17:58,480
about what it means

220
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,920
-Grandpa. -to be a father.

221
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,960
Grandpa, calm down.

222
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,320
Your blood pressure is going to spike.

223
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:05,960
I've already made peace with this.

224
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:07,280
Think about it.

225
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,120
All this time,

226
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,840
I've been carrying this whole company,

227
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,640
always having to provide for all the relatives.

228
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:12,680
If I sell it to him,

229
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,720
I can live a comfortable life.

230
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:16,560
I won't have to make money for anyone anymore.

231
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,200
I just feel it's such a waste.

232
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:21,400
You worked so hard to build this company.

233
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,920
How can you give it away to someone else so easily?

234
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:28,600
Grandpa, the company is just a shell.

235
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:32,600
In reality, it's the people that matter.

236
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:35,680
Grandpa, trust me.

237
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,200
In the blink of an eye,

238
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:40,320
I'll build a company ten times bigger than Araya Group.

239
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:41,480
I need you to trust me.

240
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,160
Of course.

241
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:45,400
I always trust you.

242
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,800
Stop being mad, okay?

243
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:49,440
And there's no need to come here.

244
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,720
If you make yourself sick getting mad,

245
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:52,600
it won't be worth it.

246
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:53,800
Grandpa,

247
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,840
I have to go now.

248
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,200
I have an urgent matter.

249
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:58,720
Let's just say that from now on,

250
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:01,560
I'll have plenty of time to talk to you.

251
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:05,320
Hanging up now.

252
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:33,360
Hello.

253
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,440
-Hello. -Hello.

254
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:37,960
Since you're bold enough to make this proposal,

255
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,400
I'll give you a chance.

256
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:42,520
Just don't let me down.

257
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:43,920
I won't.

258
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:44,800
Let me tell you,

259
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:46,960
luxury style is old-fashioned now.

260
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:48,040
These days, it has to be cozy.

261
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:49,080
I want clients to feel at home

262
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:50,280
right when they enter the place, like...

263
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:51,880
This is what the new generation

264
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,280
actually prefers.

265
00:21:39,560 --> 00:21:40,400
Those in favor of

266
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,400
the land development

267
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,600
for a resort in northern Phuket,

268
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:45,040
please raise your hands.

269
00:21:52,320 --> 00:21:55,680
[Land Purchase Agreement]

270
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:58,680
[Buyer: Tottiwa Adularaya]

271
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,560
The most important thing is this.

272
00:22:03,120 --> 00:22:04,240
Mr. Jettana,

273
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,520
I'll be blunt.

274
00:22:06,080 --> 00:22:06,960
Ing's brother

275
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:08,560
has bought up all the creditor companies

276
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:10,240
for the Phuket land.

277
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:12,960
Once Mr. Ing purchased the land,

278
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:16,360
what awaited him was billions in penalty fees.

279
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:17,960
You're riding a tiger now.

280
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:21,120
Even if you want to get off, you can't.

281
00:22:24,120 --> 00:22:25,000
I guess Director Jettana

282
00:22:25,040 --> 00:22:27,200
was keeping this as insurance,

283
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,960
but he uploaded it by mistake.

284
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:31,320
No one has clean hands.

285
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:33,120
It's a total mess.

286
00:22:34,960 --> 00:22:36,600
This is enough to turn the tables.

287
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:38,200
Thank you so much, P'Phu.

288
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:39,720
I'll handle the rest.

289
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:37,880
Who's that?

290
00:23:38,920 --> 00:23:40,120
Who the hell are you?

291
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,080
What are you doing here?

292
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:48,800
I've been waiting for you

293
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,520
to come home.

294
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:52,480
Home?

295
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:55,880
This place isn't my home.

296
00:23:57,080 --> 00:23:58,400
It's just a piece of property.

297
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:01,680
You really are something.

298
00:24:02,120 --> 00:24:03,640
Not only did you embezzle my money,

299
00:24:04,960 --> 00:24:06,840
but you also stole my clothes to wear.

300
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:08,560
Do you have any shame at all?

301
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,040
You can get out now.

302
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,440
I'm selling this place tomorrow.

303
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:14,400
You're going to sell it?

304
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:18,560
Yeah, I am.

305
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:21,320
Forty million. You buying?

306
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:23,840
Oh...

307
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:26,080
I guess that's just pocket change for you now.

308
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:28,080
You're rolling in it lately, aren't you?

309
00:24:28,080 --> 00:24:29,840
Must be nice after you and Itt ripped me off.

310
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:31,320
You can easily afford this.

311
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,320
Fine.

312
00:24:36,520 --> 00:24:37,400
I'll buy it.

313
00:24:40,840 --> 00:24:41,600
Junior.

314
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:43,200
-Yes? -Pack my things on the second floor.

315
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:44,440
Pack all of my clothes.

316
00:24:47,040 --> 00:24:48,000
Bring the bag, too.

317
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:58,680
Junior?

318
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:01,760
Is he the Junior you called?

319
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:04,440
You said you weren't in touch with him anymore.

320
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:15,800
I lied to you.

321
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:16,880
You were just too stupid.

322
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,440
Why?

323
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:20,280
What I did

324
00:25:20,280 --> 00:25:21,800
is nothing compared to what you did to me.

325
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:22,680
Let me tell you that.

326
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,080
Go on. Don't be afraid.

327
00:25:28,120 --> 00:25:28,760
Okay.

328
00:25:28,960 --> 00:25:29,760
Go.

329
00:25:30,560 --> 00:25:31,080
He's just a nerd.

330
00:25:31,080 --> 00:25:32,200
What are you afraid of? Come on.

331
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,600
Go pack my things.

332
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,320
Alright.

333
00:25:40,560 --> 00:25:41,680
Who said you could go in?

334
00:25:41,720 --> 00:25:43,960
Who do you think you are, messing with my boy?

335
00:25:46,880 --> 00:25:48,200
Pack the clothes upstairs.

336
00:25:48,560 --> 00:25:49,360
Now.

337
00:25:49,560 --> 00:25:50,480
Alright.

338
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,320
Are you dating him?

339
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:57,920
We haven't even broken up yet.

340
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:01,040
What a load of rubbish.

341
00:26:04,080 --> 00:26:04,800
Hurry it up.

342
00:26:04,800 --> 00:26:06,040
I don't want to stay here any longer.

343
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:10,080
P'Ing, please don't go.

344
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:13,480
Everything you said...

345
00:26:13,520 --> 00:26:14,680
was completely right.

346
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:17,960
I was too full of myself.

347
00:26:18,920 --> 00:26:20,840
Please give me a chance to make it up to you.

348
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:24,000
The only way you can make it up to me

349
00:26:24,040 --> 00:26:25,480
is to get the hell out of my sight.

350
00:26:25,520 --> 00:26:26,960
I'm sick of you.

351
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:29,600
P'Ing...

352
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:31,520
I've got proof

353
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:32,760
that Itt framed P'Phet

354
00:26:32,800 --> 00:26:35,920
and stole the company's trade secrets.

355
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:38,080
Do you think I'm a complete idiot?

356
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:41,520
You think everyone is stupid enough to believe your lies?

357
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:43,800
You've lied to me time and time again.

358
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:46,880
What makes you think I'd trust you this time?

359
00:26:51,760 --> 00:26:52,520
Are you done yet?

360
00:26:52,520 --> 00:26:53,800
P'Ing, hey.

361
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:54,960
Look at the evidence first.

362
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:56,720
I told you, I'm done with this.

363
00:26:58,400 --> 00:26:59,480
Listen to me.

364
00:27:00,080 --> 00:27:01,480
I'm not going to care about anything anymore.

365
00:27:01,520 --> 00:27:02,320
Not you,

366
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:03,720
Itt, or Pite.

367
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:04,960
I'm done with all of you.

368
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:05,640
Dammit.

369
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:07,280
After everything I've done for you,

370
00:27:07,320 --> 00:27:09,120
this is what I get in return?

371
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:10,440
You'd better listen closely.

372
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:11,680
From now on, my life...

373
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:12,920
is mine alone.

374
00:27:13,120 --> 00:27:14,640
I'll only care about myself.

375
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,200
None of you will have a chance.

376
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:19,560
Junior, get down here.

377
00:27:19,600 --> 00:27:20,760
Forget the stuff. Just throw it away.

378
00:27:20,800 --> 00:27:21,800
I'll just buy new ones.

379
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,320
I don't want this, either.

380
00:27:29,320 --> 00:27:30,520
I'm replacing everything.

381
00:27:30,880 --> 00:27:31,880
Come with me.

382
00:27:35,080 --> 00:27:36,840
This is so damn annoying.

383
00:27:37,600 --> 00:27:38,200
Come on.

384
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:40,960
Junior...

385
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:46,680
Let go of me.

386
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:50,800
P'Ing,

387
00:27:51,080 --> 00:27:52,880
you forced your way into my life.

388
00:27:53,320 --> 00:27:55,440
You can't just walk out on me like this.

389
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,760
Let me go.

390
00:28:09,280 --> 00:28:10,040
P'Ing.

391
00:28:10,680 --> 00:28:11,440
Hey.

392
00:28:12,640 --> 00:28:13,480
P'Ing...

393
00:28:15,080 --> 00:28:15,920
P'Ing.

394
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,520
Let's go.

395
00:28:23,680 --> 00:28:24,480
P'Ing...

396
00:28:30,360 --> 00:28:31,640
Secretary Piang...

397
00:28:32,480 --> 00:28:34,600
Auntie, Mr. Ing gave this to you.

398
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:35,680
Please just take it.

399
00:28:36,320 --> 00:28:37,680
I really can't.

400
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:39,400
I really can't accept this.

401
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:41,440
Please give it back to him for me.

402
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:44,480
But I doubt he will take it back.

403
00:28:46,280 --> 00:28:47,320
Yok, what are you doing here?

404
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:49,520
P'Piang, where's P'Ing?

405
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,200
I'm afraid I can't tell you that.

406
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:55,680
Please, I'm begging you.

407
00:28:55,800 --> 00:28:57,240
I have plenty of evidence

408
00:28:57,280 --> 00:28:58,560
that can take Itt down.

409
00:28:58,600 --> 00:28:59,720
It's too late, Yok.

410
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:02,880
Mr. Ing already signed over all his shares.

411
00:29:04,320 --> 00:29:05,520
He signed over his shares?

412
00:29:07,040 --> 00:29:08,920
His father came by this afternoon.

413
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:11,520
I don't know what they discussed,

414
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:12,760
but after that,

415
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:14,520
Mr. Ing signed everything over

416
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:16,280
to Mr. Itt.

417
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:19,600
It's too late, Yok.

418
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:24,800
Now, if you'll excuse me.

419
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,960
Yok, could you take this?

420
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:35,560
I don't know what's gotten into the CEO today.

421
00:29:35,600 --> 00:29:38,200
He just tossed this at me and walked off.

422
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:39,680
I took a look inside

423
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:40,960
and nearly had a heart attack.

424
00:29:41,080 --> 00:29:42,040
It's so expensive.

425
00:29:42,360 --> 00:29:44,080
I couldn't possibly keep it.

426
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:46,560
Please return it to him for me.

427
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:47,800
I'll take my leave now.

428
00:30:54,360 --> 00:30:55,200
Hello?

429
00:30:55,320 --> 00:30:56,200
Hello.

430
00:30:58,600 --> 00:30:59,720
Why are you the one answering?

431
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:00,760
Where's Dad?

432
00:31:02,120 --> 00:31:03,280
He's out.

433
00:31:03,360 --> 00:31:05,680
He's picking up the relatives who are arriving.

434
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:08,040
Picking them up for what?

435
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:10,200
Oh, my goodness.

436
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:12,440
I forgot to tell you. We're not having dinner at home

437
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:13,960
this New Year's.

438
00:31:14,320 --> 00:31:16,480
Itt booked a dining room elsewhere

439
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:19,040
specifically to host the relatives.

440
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:20,920
I'll send you the location.

441
00:31:41,840 --> 00:31:44,680
I've been telling you that Itt is a good son.

442
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:46,600
Oh, it's a Birkin.

443
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:49,720
-So luxurious. -Oh, I love it.

444
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,040
-I'm so jealous. -Congrats, Mom.

445
00:31:51,040 --> 00:31:52,400
-Isn't it pretty? -Yes.

446
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:53,800
No need to be jealous.

447
00:31:53,840 --> 00:31:55,240
I told you.

448
00:31:55,280 --> 00:31:56,280
Let's eat.

449
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:57,840
-Come on. -Alright.

450
00:31:57,880 --> 00:31:59,160
Things are going to get busy for you,

451
00:31:59,160 --> 00:32:00,680
so make sure you take care of yourself.

452
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:01,200
Thank you, Mom.

453
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:02,280
Exactly, Itt.

454
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:05,520
-That's right. -Yeah.

455
00:32:06,360 --> 00:32:10,280
-Congratulations, Itt. -Congratulations. Well done.

456
00:32:11,040 --> 00:32:12,840
Don't let them outshine you.

457
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:15,000
Itt, try some of the shrimp.

458
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:15,920
From now on,

459
00:32:15,920 --> 00:32:19,320
my husband and I will have to rely on you.

460
00:32:19,920 --> 00:32:20,840
Cheers, honey.

461
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:23,400
Eat up, son.

462
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:41,520
Oh, Ing. You're here?

463
00:32:41,840 --> 00:32:42,800
Come on in.

464
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:46,080
Ing, why are you here so late?

465
00:32:46,080 --> 00:32:47,240
It's my fault.

466
00:32:47,840 --> 00:32:48,800
I was caught up with things,

467
00:32:48,840 --> 00:32:50,720
so I forgot to let him know.

468
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:53,840
Excuse me? Please get us one more seat.

469
00:32:56,360 --> 00:32:57,760
Oh, yeah?

470
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:01,160
You forgot to tell me?

471
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:08,400
I suppose mistresses

472
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:10,800
love doing things behind everyone's back.

473
00:33:11,120 --> 00:33:11,800
Ing.

474
00:33:15,800 --> 00:33:16,920
Arisara,

475
00:33:17,560 --> 00:33:18,840
let me tell you something.

476
00:33:20,280 --> 00:33:22,080
You could win against my mom,

477
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:24,680
move into this family,

478
00:33:25,080 --> 00:33:27,200
and even bear my dad a son.

479
00:33:28,680 --> 00:33:30,600
But at the end of the day, everyone in this room

480
00:33:32,560 --> 00:33:35,240
will see you as a mistress for the rest of your life.

481
00:33:35,280 --> 00:33:37,320
Ing, that's enough.

482
00:33:38,120 --> 00:33:39,440
Shut your mouth right now.

483
00:33:41,320 --> 00:33:42,320
Exactly, Ing.

484
00:33:43,360 --> 00:33:44,880
You're being rude.

485
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:46,120
Yeah.

486
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:49,680
It's New Year's. Let's not dig up the past.

487
00:33:57,800 --> 00:33:58,920
Damn.

488
00:34:00,760 --> 00:34:02,680
This family is unbelievable.

489
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:05,360
Fine.

490
00:34:05,840 --> 00:34:07,920
If you love sucking up to them, please carry on.

491
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:09,800
Logic clearly isn't welcome here.

492
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:11,639
-Hey. -What?

493
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,679
Are you ashamed?

494
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:18,000
I'm really sorry. It's just that...

495
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:23,280
no one ever taught me any manners

496
00:34:24,280 --> 00:34:25,679
since my mom died young.

497
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:28,000
Please don't take offense.

498
00:34:32,120 --> 00:34:32,800
Itt,

499
00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:35,760
regarding the shares,

500
00:34:36,600 --> 00:34:37,480
I'll give you a discount.

501
00:34:39,159 --> 00:34:40,719
Think of it as your mom's fee

502
00:34:40,719 --> 00:34:42,280
that my dad never paid.

503
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,600
Enjoy your meal.

504
00:34:59,360 --> 00:35:01,960
I'll go see him out.

505
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:03,440
Itt...

506
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:04,680
It's fine.

507
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:06,000
I'm okay, Mom.

508
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:08,880
Please enjoy the rest of your dinner.

509
00:35:09,480 --> 00:35:10,200
It's okay.

510
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:14,400
It's going to be okay.

511
00:35:20,560 --> 00:35:22,720
Ing is just unbelievable.

512
00:35:27,600 --> 00:35:28,320
P'Ing.

513
00:35:28,680 --> 00:35:29,720
What now?

514
00:36:19,240 --> 00:36:21,400
[My Capy, from now on,]

515
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:24,040
[I'll cherish you and take care of you the best I can.]

516
00:36:32,240 --> 00:36:34,120
If I gave you a ring, would you take it?

517
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,720
What did you just say?

518
00:36:36,120 --> 00:36:38,760
Nothing. Just telling you to get home safe.

519
00:36:44,600 --> 00:36:46,640
[My Capy, from now on,]

520
00:36:46,680 --> 00:36:49,640
[I'll cherish you and take care of you the best I can.]

521
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:03,680
Hello, P'Phu.

522
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:06,200
Could you track the location of P'Ing's phone for me?

523
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,960
I need to know where he is.

524
00:38:08,160 --> 00:38:09,480
I'll give you his number.

525
00:38:09,560 --> 00:38:10,640
Whoa, hold on.

526
00:38:10,640 --> 00:38:12,200
You think I'm in the FBI or something?

527
00:38:12,600 --> 00:38:13,760
Tracking a location and digging for data

528
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:15,040
are two different things.

529
00:38:15,240 --> 00:38:17,360
If I get caught, I'm going straight to prison.

530
00:38:17,720 --> 00:38:19,240
So that means you can do it, right?

531
00:38:20,160 --> 00:38:21,600
I'm begging you, P'Phu.

532
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:22,680
Please help me.

533
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:23,720
Fine, fine.

534
00:38:23,720 --> 00:38:25,640
I'm only going to try.

535
00:38:25,640 --> 00:38:26,880
No guarantees, okay?

536
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:28,880
Okay. Thank you so much.

537
00:38:38,160 --> 00:38:38,800
[System: No SIM]

538
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:11,360
You're awake?

539
00:39:13,600 --> 00:39:14,400
Itt?

540
00:39:15,440 --> 00:39:16,880
What the hell are you doing?

541
00:39:18,600 --> 00:39:20,280
This is the first building of yours and Yok's.

542
00:39:20,600 --> 00:39:22,040
I decorated it myself.

543
00:39:22,760 --> 00:39:23,960
How do you like it?

544
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:26,680
What are you trying to do?

545
00:39:27,520 --> 00:39:28,520
Let me go.

546
00:39:31,920 --> 00:39:34,200
P'Ing, I just wanted to talk to you,

547
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:37,800
but you wouldn't even look at me anymore.

548
00:39:41,480 --> 00:39:42,440
Who do you think you are?

549
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,960
Why should I look at you?

550
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:45,800
Let me go.

551
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:48,920
If you think I used to bully you,

552
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:50,120
you've already had your revenge.

553
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:01,640
Now that you've taken everything from me,

554
00:40:01,640 --> 00:40:03,000
isn't it enough?

555
00:40:09,440 --> 00:40:10,280
P'Ing...

556
00:40:11,520 --> 00:40:13,520
If this were just about revenge,

557
00:40:14,080 --> 00:40:15,880
I wouldn't be suffering this much.

558
00:40:17,360 --> 00:40:19,000
The way I feel about you...

559
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,880
is more than just that.

560
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:24,960
Have you lost your mind?

561
00:40:25,880 --> 00:40:27,080
What do you mean, you're suffering?

562
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:28,600
The way you feel about me?

563
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:30,680
Let me go right now.

564
00:40:35,120 --> 00:40:35,800
Do you remember

565
00:40:35,800 --> 00:40:37,360
the first time we met?

566
00:40:38,760 --> 00:40:41,560
I must have been about five years old then.

567
00:40:45,120 --> 00:40:48,160
Mom told me to say hi to you, but I was too afraid...

568
00:40:49,760 --> 00:40:53,120
because the way you looked at me was terrifying.

569
00:40:59,240 --> 00:41:00,960
I don't know if you remember,

570
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,240
but in all my life,

571
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:08,480
I will never forget.

572
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:18,520
Welcome to your new home.

573
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:22,160
You were wearing a white shirt.

574
00:41:27,800 --> 00:41:29,840
The first glimpse I caught of you,

575
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:32,640
I just felt that...

576
00:41:33,720 --> 00:41:35,240
you were so beautiful.

577
00:41:38,120 --> 00:41:40,800
So beautiful I couldn't take my eyes off you.

578
00:41:42,160 --> 00:41:43,960
I couldn't help but wonder,

579
00:41:44,440 --> 00:41:46,600
if I had behaved a little better,

580
00:41:47,080 --> 00:41:48,880
would you have liked me back?

581
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:52,120
Would you have stopped picking on me?

582
00:41:56,720 --> 00:41:58,800
-People are funny, aren't they? -Why are you following me?

583
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:00,520
-As time passed, -Are you crazy?

584
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:02,120
I grew used to it.

585
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:05,080
Before I knew it, I loved every moment

586
00:42:05,840 --> 00:42:07,280
spent staring at you

587
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:09,960
and following you around.

588
00:42:10,680 --> 00:42:13,560
You were so mean when we were kids.

589
00:42:14,640 --> 00:42:15,920
There was that one time

590
00:42:16,480 --> 00:42:18,160
you were going to teach me how to swim.

591
00:42:23,680 --> 00:42:25,440
But you just threw me into the pool.

592
00:42:30,120 --> 00:42:31,720
You almost killed me.

593
00:42:42,480 --> 00:42:43,880
Don't be such a wimp.

594
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:44,800
The water only reaches your chest.

595
00:42:44,800 --> 00:42:45,680
Itt.

596
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:48,880
Pull my son out of there right now.

597
00:42:51,840 --> 00:42:52,800
It's alright, sweetie.

598
00:42:57,880 --> 00:42:59,640
Are you okay, sweetie?

599
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:01,720
I wanted to cry so badly.

600
00:43:01,920 --> 00:43:03,440
But I was too afraid to cry in front of you.

601
00:43:03,480 --> 00:43:04,800
Don't let him teach you anything now.

602
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:06,320
-Because if I did, -How are you?

603
00:43:06,560 --> 00:43:07,840
-you would only get angrier. -Are you hurt?

604
00:43:09,040 --> 00:43:10,560
In my mind,

605
00:43:11,120 --> 00:43:13,320
you were nothing but a cruel monster.

606
00:43:15,360 --> 00:43:17,200
I couldn't help but stare at you,

607
00:43:18,320 --> 00:43:19,600
but every time I did,

608
00:43:20,400 --> 00:43:21,920
I just wanted to run away and hide.

609
00:43:28,320 --> 00:43:29,960
-Yet you protected me quite often. -Give it back.

610
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:30,960
Give it back to me.

611
00:43:31,160 --> 00:43:32,680
-Give it back. -There was this one time...

612
00:43:32,680 --> 00:43:33,520
Give it to me.

613
00:43:33,520 --> 00:43:34,600
-Your brother? -When I just started primary school...

614
00:43:34,600 --> 00:43:35,440
He's a hero?

615
00:43:35,480 --> 00:43:37,480
-I was being bullied by my friends, -Give it back to me.

616
00:43:37,520 --> 00:43:39,280
but you stood up for me.

617
00:43:40,160 --> 00:43:42,800
He's my brother. Only I can mess with him.

618
00:43:45,160 --> 00:43:46,160
You want some more?

619
00:43:54,960 --> 00:43:56,520
You drew me looking so ugly.

620
00:44:03,080 --> 00:44:03,960
I used to wonder

621
00:44:04,000 --> 00:44:05,960
what was so great about being your brother.

622
00:44:06,160 --> 00:44:07,760
You'd even hit me sometimes.

623
00:44:11,480 --> 00:44:14,640
But deep down, I felt an inexplicable sense of joy,

624
00:44:16,040 --> 00:44:17,880
even though you never admitted

625
00:44:17,920 --> 00:44:19,560
that I was your brother.

626
00:44:22,800 --> 00:44:26,280
I was scared of you, but I also respected you so much.

627
00:44:30,800 --> 00:44:32,640
You're good at everything, so I thought that

628
00:44:32,920 --> 00:44:34,080
if I could just...

629
00:44:42,920 --> 00:44:43,920
If...

630
00:44:50,120 --> 00:44:51,400
Let go of me.

631
00:44:52,360 --> 00:44:53,760
You know I didn't do anything wrong.

632
00:44:53,960 --> 00:44:55,680
I was only a bit hard on you.

633
00:45:04,160 --> 00:45:05,320
I'm sorry.

634
00:45:06,520 --> 00:45:07,760
Happy now?

635
00:45:11,880 --> 00:45:14,160
If you keep your eyes on someone long enough,

636
00:45:14,160 --> 00:45:16,040
especially someone as hot as you,

637
00:45:19,520 --> 00:45:20,840
you eventually find yourself

638
00:45:20,880 --> 00:45:22,840
unable to look away.

639
00:45:28,840 --> 00:45:30,040
All these years,

640
00:45:30,600 --> 00:45:31,920
you've been the only one on my mind.

641
00:45:33,080 --> 00:45:33,800
Your flings

642
00:45:33,800 --> 00:45:34,880
and even Yok...

643
00:45:35,120 --> 00:45:37,000
All of them combined could never love you as much as I do.

644
00:45:38,280 --> 00:45:39,760
If I could go back in time,

645
00:45:40,680 --> 00:45:43,080
I never would've let Yok set foot in our home.

646
00:45:44,120 --> 00:45:44,960
Itt,

647
00:45:45,800 --> 00:45:47,080
do you realize what you're saying?

648
00:45:47,120 --> 00:45:48,200
Are you out of your mind?

649
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:50,960
I do.

650
00:46:01,520 --> 00:46:03,360
I've kept this rope for a very long time.

651
00:46:04,040 --> 00:46:05,520
Guess it can't hold you anymore.

652
00:46:06,560 --> 00:46:07,680
What a pity.

653
00:46:08,200 --> 00:46:10,120
It's packed with so many memories.

654
00:46:14,320 --> 00:46:15,200
Damn...

655
00:46:15,800 --> 00:46:17,120
You should just use this rope

656
00:46:17,120 --> 00:46:19,080
to hang yourself, you pervert.

657
00:46:20,920 --> 00:46:22,000
Don't move.

658
00:46:22,720 --> 00:46:23,960
Your skin is all chafed.

659
00:46:25,760 --> 00:46:26,480
Itt,

660
00:46:26,720 --> 00:46:28,680
I don't know what you're trying to do,

661
00:46:28,920 --> 00:46:29,960
but if you stop now,

662
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:31,840
I'll pretend like this never happened.

663
00:46:31,960 --> 00:46:33,520
And I won't hold any of this against you.

664
00:46:33,760 --> 00:46:35,520
Are you even listening to me?

665
00:46:38,120 --> 00:46:38,920
Let me go.

666
00:46:41,840 --> 00:46:42,720
Damn...

667
00:46:44,400 --> 00:46:45,640
I suppose so.

668
00:46:48,560 --> 00:46:50,200
If Yok hadn't come between us,

669
00:46:51,400 --> 00:46:53,800
I might've waited a few more years.

670
00:46:55,480 --> 00:46:58,400
But I can't take it anymore.

671
00:46:59,720 --> 00:47:01,680
I can't stand seeing you two in love.

672
00:47:03,200 --> 00:47:03,800
Hey.

673
00:47:04,000 --> 00:47:05,040
What are you doing?

674
00:47:05,480 --> 00:47:06,920
As long as I can make you mine...

675
00:47:06,960 --> 00:47:07,720
Itt...

676
00:47:08,040 --> 00:47:09,280
I don't care about anything else.

677
00:47:09,880 --> 00:47:11,120
What the hell are you doing?

678
00:47:18,200 --> 00:47:19,120
Hey...

679
00:47:23,920 --> 00:47:25,360
What the hell are you trying to do?

680
00:47:27,920 --> 00:47:28,880
Itt,

681
00:47:29,200 --> 00:47:30,840
are you insane?

682
00:47:31,200 --> 00:47:31,960
Hey.

683
00:47:32,520 --> 00:47:33,360
You'd better think this through.

684
00:47:33,400 --> 00:47:34,960
I'm your brother.

685
00:47:40,680 --> 00:47:42,200
I know, brother.

686
00:47:43,360 --> 00:47:44,960
But don't you want to try?

687
00:47:46,800 --> 00:47:48,520
Since you're always up for trying new things,

688
00:47:50,360 --> 00:47:51,320
you might actually enjoy it

689
00:47:52,480 --> 00:47:53,920
once you give it a try.

690
00:47:55,760 --> 00:47:57,280
Like hell I will.

691
00:49:01,680 --> 00:49:03,560
You're still wearing this scent, aren't you?

692
00:49:05,440 --> 00:49:06,400
You know what?

693
00:49:07,480 --> 00:49:08,640
Just catching a whiff of it,

694
00:49:09,600 --> 00:49:11,080
and I'm already hard.

695
00:49:11,120 --> 00:49:12,000
You pervert.

696
00:49:12,120 --> 00:49:12,800
Damn it.

697
00:49:12,920 --> 00:49:15,320
Have you lost your damn mind?

698
00:49:15,360 --> 00:49:16,800
I'm your freaking brother,

699
00:49:16,880 --> 00:49:17,840
for God's sake.

700
00:49:19,760 --> 00:49:20,800
Stop it, Itt.

701
00:49:22,000 --> 00:49:22,760
Itt...

702
00:49:23,120 --> 00:49:24,160
Stop it.

703
00:49:24,880 --> 00:49:25,720
Itt...

704
00:49:26,520 --> 00:49:27,720
I told you to stop.

705
00:49:47,200 --> 00:49:48,400
Hello, P'Ing?

706
00:49:48,920 --> 00:49:49,880
Where are you?

707
00:49:50,760 --> 00:49:52,200
I'm his brother.

708
00:49:52,840 --> 00:49:54,280
He's busy right now.

709
00:49:54,280 --> 00:49:55,680
Put him on the phone.

710
00:49:56,040 --> 00:49:57,640
You have no right to speak for him.

711
00:49:58,000 --> 00:49:59,800
What goes on between us is none of your business.

712
00:50:00,200 --> 00:50:02,400
He had too much to drink with the relatives,

713
00:50:03,840 --> 00:50:05,560
so I'm about to take him home.

714
00:50:07,360 --> 00:50:08,600
He doesn't want to see you.

715
00:50:09,320 --> 00:50:10,520
Stop calling him.

716
00:50:16,080 --> 00:50:16,920
Yok.

717
00:50:18,520 --> 00:50:19,800
Who the hell do you think you are?

718
00:50:20,360 --> 00:50:22,040
You're just a fling for him.

719
00:50:22,760 --> 00:50:24,360
He'll forget you in no time.

720
00:50:24,880 --> 00:50:26,640
Don't go thinking you're special.

721
00:50:27,640 --> 00:50:28,560
Let me go, Itt.

722
00:50:28,560 --> 00:50:29,200
Help me.

723
00:50:52,680 --> 00:50:54,360
Do you really think he can save you?

724
00:50:55,360 --> 00:50:56,600
Let me tell you something.

725
00:50:57,640 --> 00:50:58,680
Not a chance.

726
00:50:59,240 --> 00:51:00,880
He'll never find this place.

727
00:51:02,720 --> 00:51:03,520
Itt,

728
00:51:03,800 --> 00:51:05,760
what the hell is wrong with you?

729
00:51:06,120 --> 00:51:07,320
You'd better remember this.

730
00:51:07,760 --> 00:51:09,120
I'm going to kill you.

731
00:51:13,040 --> 00:51:15,600
What would I get out of being a good brother to you

732
00:51:16,120 --> 00:51:17,440
for the rest of my life?

733
00:51:19,240 --> 00:51:20,680
You'd still never care about me.

734
00:51:22,600 --> 00:51:23,520
That's why...

735
00:51:24,120 --> 00:51:25,600
I don't regret anything

736
00:51:26,240 --> 00:51:27,440
I've done,

737
00:51:28,640 --> 00:51:30,560
even if you kill me for it.

738
00:51:31,440 --> 00:51:32,640
Just you wait.

739
00:51:33,000 --> 00:51:34,080
I'm going to kill you.

740
00:51:34,760 --> 00:51:36,040
I'm going to kill you, Itt.

741
00:51:38,640 --> 00:51:40,240
The one who really deserves you

742
00:51:41,600 --> 00:51:42,440
is me,

743
00:51:42,920 --> 00:51:44,040
not that bastard Yok.

744
00:51:47,680 --> 00:51:49,120
The coordinates lead to that building.

745
00:52:21,320 --> 00:52:22,960
From now on, this area...

746
00:52:23,920 --> 00:52:25,280
will be where your first building stands.

747
00:52:52,000 --> 00:52:52,880
P'Ing...

748
00:52:54,320 --> 00:52:55,600
I love you.

749
00:53:00,080 --> 00:53:01,600
After tonight...

750
00:53:05,520 --> 00:53:07,200
You'll finally be mine.

751
00:53:19,760 --> 00:53:21,080
How could you do this?

752
00:53:22,120 --> 00:53:23,480
-Come home with me. -Let go.

753
00:53:26,480 --> 00:53:27,800
Leave me alone.

754
00:53:29,000 --> 00:53:30,240
This is Mrs. Arisara.

755
00:53:30,280 --> 00:53:32,720
She's in charge of investment and management.

756
00:53:32,720 --> 00:53:34,800
I guess P'Ing and Itt never told you

757
00:53:35,160 --> 00:53:36,560
who the real victim was.

758
00:53:36,640 --> 00:53:38,400
Just because I used to like you,

759
00:53:38,720 --> 00:53:40,120
does that mean I owe you something?

760
00:53:40,320 --> 00:53:41,920
What happened between you two?

761
00:53:42,120 --> 00:53:43,600
I'm sorry, P'Ing.

762
00:53:43,800 --> 00:53:45,520
Yok and I aren't together anymore.

763
00:53:45,560 --> 00:53:47,240
-Yok... -I love P'Ing

764
00:53:47,360 --> 00:53:48,680
so much that I can't even control myself.

765
00:53:51,160 --> 00:53:54,400
[The UNCUT version of Fool in Love]

766
00:53:54,440 --> 00:53:57,600
[is exclusively available on iQIYI and iQ.com]
